orical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"僅記本文明示關係，不由繼位推導父子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p003","text":"后稷卒，子不窋立。不窋末年，夏后氏政衰，去稷不務，不窋以失其官而犇戎狄之間。不窋卒，子鞠立。鞠卒，子公劉立。公劉雖在戎狄之間，復修后稷之業，務耕種，行地宜，自漆、沮度渭，取材用，行者有資，居者有畜積，民賴其慶。百姓懷之，多徙而保歸焉。周道之興自此始，故詩人歌樂思其德。公劉卒，子慶節立，國於豳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000160","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000160","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"夏后氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定個人、群體或氏族稱謂；不推造個別姓名與成員數目。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000160","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"不窋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000160","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000161","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"鞠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000161","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000162","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000162","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000162","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m003-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"慶節","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000163","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p004","text":"慶節卒，子皇仆立。皇仆卒，子差弗立。差弗卒，子毀隃立。毀隃卒，子公非立。公非卒，子高圉立。高圉卒，子亞圉立。亞圉卒，子公叔祖類立。公叔祖類卒，子古公亶父立。古公亶父復修后稷、公劉之業，積德行義，國人皆戴之。薰育戎狄攻之，欲得財物，予之。已復攻，欲得地與民。民皆怒，欲戰。古公曰：「有民立君，將以利之。今戎狄所為攻戰，以吾地與民。民之在我，與其在彼，何異。民欲以我故戰，殺人父子而君之，予不忍為。」乃與私屬遂去豳，度漆、沮，踰梁山，止於岐下。豳人舉國扶老攜弱，盡復歸古公於岐下。及他旁國聞古公仁，亦多歸之。於是古公乃貶戎狄之俗，而營筑城郭室屋，而邑別居之。作五官有司。民皆歌樂之，頌其德。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"慶節","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000163","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"皇仆","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000164","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"皇仆","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000164","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"差弗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000165","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"差弗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000165","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"毀隃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000166","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"毀隃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000166","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m004-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"公非","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000167","status":"source_identified"},{